  "Question": "At the same time, a vertically placed bamboo pole \\(2\\text{ m}\\) long casts a shadow \\(1.5\\text{ m}\\) long, and a tree casts a shadow \\(6\\text{ m}\\) long. Find the height of the tree. (Unit: m)",
